  "content": "<p>美人鱼模组添加了一条神奇的项链，让你在水中化身为美人鱼！更多信息，请参考<a href=\"https://github.com/ThatPreston/Mermod-Fabric/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">官方维基。</a></p><p>从3.0.0版本开始，本模组需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a> 的支持。</p><p>对于本模组的Fabric版本，请<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mermod-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击此处。</a></p><p>官方Discord服务器：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QS9Daqs4WX\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.gg/QS9Daqs4WX</a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/8fbbf2cef1eec3f1ae867b615963e510.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"704\" height=\"87\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52404366/171579611-f2a2b24b-8d08-46e4-8bc6-f388545266ae.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"258\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52404366/171579631-12870cc2-0dcc-4c83-9c7e-4a0745e50db4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"258\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/367c0814ff468713195e1d60bd7aaaba.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"704\" height=\"176\"></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/52404366/177890474-3397e1d9-533a-4dfe-a345-ffe381b4d84b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"528\" height=\"258\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/6b713760595919050fe09b66b3bc8fd9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"704\" height=\"592\"></p>",
